{"seq":2,"slug":"organic-chemistry","title":"有机化学","stage":"DONE","category":"chemistry","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.1,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 有机化学\n\n有机化学（Organic Chemistry）是研究含碳化合物的结构、性质、合成及反应机理的化学分支。碳原子因其独特的四价成键能力和形成稳定共价键的倾向，能够构建从简单甲烷到复杂蛋白质、DNA 的无穷分子骨架。有机化学不仅是生命科学的分子语言，也是制药工业、材料科学、农业化学和能源技术的理论基础。\n\n本知识库系统介绍有机化学的核心内容：从碳的成键规律和官能团命名出发，深入讨论经典反应机理（亲核取代、消除、加成），再扩展至芳香族化学和羰基化学，最终上升到合成策略层面——逆合成分析、保护基策略和现代偶联反应。这一编排遵循\"结构决定性质，性质决定反应，反应服务于合成\"的逻辑主线，力求帮助读者建立从分子识别到合成设计的完整思维框架。\n\n本 Hub 面向具有高中化学基础的成人自学者。内容假设读者了解基本的化学键概念、Lewis 结构和简单分子式书写，在此基础上系统讲解杂化轨道理论、立体化学、电子效应、反应能量学等大学有机化学核心知识。学习完成后，读者将具备阅读有机化学专业教材（如 Clayden、McMurry）和理解基础文献的能力。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"structure-nomenclature","title":"结构与命名","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/structure-nomenclature","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"carbon-bonding-hybridization","title":"碳的成键与杂化（Carbon Bonding and Hybridization）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/structure-nomenclature/carbon-bonding-hybridization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"functional-groups","title":"官能团分类与命名（Functional Groups: Classification and Nomenclature）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/structure-nomenclature/functional-groups"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stereochemistry","title":"立体化学：手性与构象（Stereochemistry: Chirality and Conformation）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/structure-nomenclature/stereochemistry"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"reaction-mechanisms","title":"反应机理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/reaction-mechanisms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"nucleophilic-substitution","title":"亲核取代反应 SN1/SN2（Nucleophilic Substitution: SN1 and SN2）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/reaction-mechanisms/nucleophilic-substitution"},{"seq":2,"slug":"elimination-reactions","title":"消除反应 E1/E2（Elimination Reactions: E1 and E2）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/reaction-mechanisms/elimination-reactions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"addition-reactions","title":"加成反应（Addition Reactions）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/reaction-mechanisms/addition-reactions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"aromatic-carbonyl","title":"芳香族与羰基化学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/aromatic-carbonyl","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"aromatic-chemistry","title":"芳香族化学与亲电取代（Aromatic Chemistry and Electrophilic Aromatic Substitution）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/aromatic-carbonyl/aromatic-chemistry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"carbonyl-chemistry","title":"羰基化学：醛酮酸酯（Carbonyl Chemistry: Aldehydes, Ketones, Acids, and Esters）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/aromatic-carbonyl/carbonyl-chemistry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"amine-heterocyclic","title":"胺类与杂环化合物（Amines and Heterocyclic Compounds）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/aromatic-carbonyl/amine-heterocyclic"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"synthesis-strategy","title":"合成策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/synthesis-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"retrosynthetic-analysis","title":"逆合成分析（Retrosynthetic Analysis）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/synthesis-strategy/retrosynthetic-analysis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"protecting-groups","title":"保护基策略（Protecting Group Strategy）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/synthesis-strategy/protecting-groups"},{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-coupling-reactions","title":"现代偶联反应（Modern Coupling Reactions）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/synthesis-strategy/modern-coupling-reactions"}]}]}